  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>FlexRay State Manager (FrSM)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Controls the operational states and startup/wakeup of FlexRay clusters.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00013\">FrSm_Init</a> (const FrSM_ConfigType* Fr SM_ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the Flex Ray State Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00020\">FrSM_RequestComMode</a> (NetworkHandleType NetworkHandle, ComM_ModeType Com M_Mode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API function is used by the Com M to startup or shutdown the communication on a Flex Ray cluster.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00024\">FrSM_GetCurrentComMode</a> (NetworkHandleType NetworkHandle, ComM_ModeType* Com M_ModePtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API function can be used to determine the current communication mode of a Flex Ray cluster.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00029\">FrSM_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This service returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00172\">FrSm_AllSlots</a> (NetworkHandleType NetworkHandle);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service FrSm_AllSlots.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00174\">FrSm_SetEcuPassive</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Fr SM_Passive);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API function can be used to set all Flex Ray clusters of the ECU to a receive</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00198\">FrSM_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type contains the implementation - specific post build time configuration structure</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_FrSM_00199\">FrSM_BswM_StateType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type defines the states that are reported to the Bsw</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
